{"chunkId": "52b881ea-2538-5ef1-bbe8-81fef2b55770", "text": "间隔学习：在多次学习同一内容之间设置一定时间间隔，而不是在短时间内连续集中重复，以促进知识的长期记忆和保持。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "54612639-3a6e-5a47-b1ab-2ccfcf6839e3", "text": "间隔学习的第 1 步：确定需要长期记忆的学习内容。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "da82fb9d-d04a-5582-a338-d33e78883446", "text": "间隔学习的第 2 步：进行第一次学习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "1fe977b9-cdd1-550a-baf8-832cd359af89", "text": "间隔学习的第 3 步：在两次学习之间设置时间间隔。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "97a1569e-b446-515a-8e7a-44eb644a092e", "text": "间隔学习的第 4 步：经过间隔后再次学习或练习相同内容。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "ed058e6b-1943-5282-84f8-87f910c8790c", "text": "间隔学习的第 5 步：根据学习周期继续安排后续重复。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "544c2a60-2c50-5f4a-a699-3957f8bd796b", "text": "间隔学习的第 6 步：在较长时间后进行测试或回忆，以检查长期保持效果。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 6, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "256e49fe-616a-5689-83c7-1c34dedf5449", "text": "间隔学习适合需要长期记忆的学习任务，原因是：研究综述表明，间隔学习对长期记忆保持具有较好的促进作用。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要长期记忆的学习任务"}}
{"chunkId": "048db04b-60ed-5f2c-bc26-c472dcf3190d", "text": "间隔学习适合需要多次重复学习的内容，原因是：间隔学习的核心是在多次重复呈现同一学习项目之间设置时间间隔。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要多次重复学习的内容"}}
{"chunkId": "a71d8a9e-4db3-587b-8cf6-5149e28c6cfc", "text": "间隔学习适合考试复习，原因是：可以将需要掌握的内容分散到不同时间进行重复学习，而不是集中在一次学习中完成大量重复。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "考试复习"}}
{"chunkId": "f3a1b8f3-5080-53cf-894e-65e02c286371", "text": "间隔学习不适合需要立即完成的短期任务，原因是：间隔学习强调重复学习之间存在时间间隔，因此不一定适合必须在极短时间内完成的学习任务。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要立即完成的短期任务"}}
{"chunkId": "515b04b8-9f49-5e02-859f-8791626276e9", "text": "间隔学习不适合需要立即获得集中训练效果的情境，原因是：部分研究显示，集中学习在短期表现上可能具有优势，而间隔学习的优势可能在较长时间后更加明显。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-spaced-learning", "strategyName": "间隔学习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-005"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": null, "communityScore": null, "effectivenessScore": null, "overallScore": null, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要立即获得集中训练效果的情境"}}
